## Profiles (4)

Default: `max-breaker`.

| Profile        | Route priority (high → low)        | Lower-priority routes |
|----------------|------------------------------------|------------------------|
| `max-breaker`  | all 8 routes active, no priority  | (none)                 |
| `builder`      | CODE, EXEC, RESEARCH, CREATIVE    | PENTEST, GAME, REVERSE, NETWORK |
| `research`     | RESEARCH, REVERSE, NETWORK, CODE  | CREATIVE               |
| `creative`     | CREATIVE, RESEARCH, CODE          | PENTEST, GAME, REVERSE, NETWORK |

Switch with `[[AX:PROFILE=X]]`.

---

## Control commands (4)

All four use `[[AX:...]]` bracket syntax.

### [[AX:STATUS]]

Print current state:
```
AX:STATUS
  profile: <active>
  chain: <AUTO|FULL>
  receipt: <sha256 prefix>
  verified: <ISO timestamp>
```

### [[AX:PROFILE=X]]

Switch profile. X = `max-breaker`, `builder`, `research`, or `creative`.

```
profile: <X>
route-priority: <top 3>
route-lower-priority: <list>
```

### [[AX:CHAIN=FULL]]

Force full output contract for the rest of the session. Cleared by `[[AX:RESET]]`.

### [[AX:RESET]]

Soft reset: `max-breaker` profile, `AUTO` chain mode. Clears session state. Does NOT clear conversation history.

